<title>UK: Photo-Me Intl year pretax profit drops.</title>
<headline>Photo-Me Intl year pretax profit drops.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to April 30, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		8.48		   vs 11.68</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 5.0		    vs 5.0</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    11.3		   vs 14.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   198.7		  vs 193.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Photo-Me International Plc, which manufactures and operates coin-operated automatic photo-booths, said pre-tax profits had falled in a harsh industry environment.</p>
</text>
